              "else": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "oracle_text": "Villain spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\nWhenever another Villain you control enters, you may have it connive. Do this only once each turn. (Draw a card, then discard a card. If you discarded a nonland card, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.)"
